{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:eruv/blessing"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God, King of the World, who has sanctified us with His commandments and given us the commandment of the Eruv. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:eruv_tavshilin/declaration"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Be it permitted, through this Eruv, to bake, to cook, to keep warm, to kindle a light and to prepare on the festival everything needed for the Sabbath, to us and to all who dwell in this town. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
